        },
        {
          "name": "In Glow Info",
          "type": "FDepthFieldGlowInfo&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Determine if this is a matching set by comparing texture,blendmode,elementype,transform. All must match\n@param BatchedElementParameters - parameters for this batched element\n@param InTexture - texture resource for the item being rendered\n@param InBlendMode - current alpha blend mode\n@param InElementType - type of item being rendered: triangle,line,etc\n@param InTransform - the transform for the item being rendered\n@param InGlowInfo - the depth field glow of the item being rendered\n@return true if the parameters match this render item"
